<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2029311189/eDM_Hero_50Bonus-Status-Credits_680x400.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Fly higher with 50% more Status Credits</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Soar your tier with Qantas Business Rewards. For a limited time we're offering Qantas Business Rewards members&nbsp;<b>50% bonus Status Credits</b><sup style="font-size: x-small;">1</sup>&nbsp;when they register, book and fly on eligible Qantas flights with a QF flight number before 30 June 2019.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">With a Status Credits boost, you could move up faster through our Frequent Flyer membership tiers. The more you fly, the more privileges you can enjoy.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to take up the offer</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 12px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1.</font></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 10px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Simply&nbsp;<b>register your business</b>.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 12px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">2.</font></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 10px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Book eligible flights between&nbsp;<b>29 April 2019</b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>7 May 2019</b>, for travel until&nbsp;<b>30 June 2019</b>.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 12px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">3.</font></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px 4px 10px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Remember to include your Frequent Flyer membership number and ABN in your booking.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Once your business is registered, everyone who travels on an eligible Qantas flight will earn 50% bonus Status Credits. This means more Status Credits for every traveller!</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/member-specials/qbr-bonus-status-credits-may19.html?utm_source=qbrsmemay19&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=EOFY2019&amp;utm_content=hero&amp;utm_term=register" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/member-specials/qbr-bonus-status-credits-may19.html?utm_source=qbrsmemay19&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=EOFY2019&amp;utm_content=hero&amp;utm_term=register" target="_blank" alt="Register now" title="Register now" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register now</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/member-specials/qbr-bonus-status-credits-may19.html?utm_source=qbrsmemay19&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=EOFY2019&amp;utm_content=hero&amp;utm_term=register" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 23px; margin: 0px; height: 23px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#F4F5F6" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15px; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 600px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1 To participate in this offer, Qantas Business Rewards Members must (a) register their ABN between 12.01am (AEST) 29 April 2019 and 11.59pm (AEST) 7 May 2019 and b) book a new flight booking between 12.01am (AEST) 29 April 2019 and 11.59pm (AEST) 7 May 2019, for travel between 29 April 2019 and 30 June 2019. Bonus Status Credits will be earned by the Qantas Frequent Flyer member travelling on eligible Qantas flights booked under the registered Qantas Business Rewards Member's ABN. An&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlinesavings" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Eligible Flight</a>&nbsp;for the purpose of this promotion means any Qantas operated flight with a QF flight number on the ticket where Status Credits are normally earned. Bonus Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes including Classic Flight Rewards and any flight with a QF flight number on the ticket which is not operated by Qantas including Jetstar, Jetstar Asia, Valuair, Jetstar Japan, Jetstar Pacific and other partner airlines. See the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables&nbsp;</a>for details. The Qantas Business Rewards Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking for the QFF member to earn bonus Status Credits. This offer cannot be used in conjunction with any other bonus offer by Qantas. Only one bonus Status Credits offer can be used per individual qualifying segment of your itinerary. However, bonus Status Credits may be earned on multiple eligible flight bookings if you book and travel within the promotional dates as listed above. If you qualify for multiple offers, the offer first-registered for will be applied to each individual qualifying segment. Full or part travel of an itinerary is eligible only if you book and travel within the promotional dates as listed above. If you change or cancel your initial qualifying booking and/or travel is completed outside the promotional period, this bonus offer will not apply. Bonus Status Credits may take up to 8 weeks after completion of your travel to be credited to your Qantas Frequent Flyer account.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
